Terminals unused in grammar

    UnqualifiedMethodIdentifier
    NUMBER
    TRAILING_COMMA
    LT_RelationalExpression
    RBRACK


Grammar

    0 $accept: CompilationUnit $end

    1 IdentifierComplement: VAR_IdentifierComplement
    2                     | SEALED_IdentifierComplement
    3                     | NON_SEALED_IdentifierComplement
    4                     | YIELD_IdentifierComplement

    5 IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator
    6                            | VAR_MethodDeclarator
    7                            | YIELD_MethodDeclarator

    8 IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers
    9                                 | VAR_AnnotationIdentifiers
   10                                 | YIELD_AnnotationIdentifiers

   11 Literal: INTEGERLITERAL
   12        | FLOATINGPOINTLITERAL
   13        | TRUE
   14        | FALSE
   15        | CHARACTERLITERAL
   16        | STRINGLITERAL
   17        | TextBlock
   18        | MY_NULL

   19 Modifier: Annotation_Modifier
   20         | PUBLIC
   21         | PROTECTED
   22         | PRIVATE
   23         | ABSTRACT
   24         | STATIC
   25         | FINAL
   26         | STRICTFP
   27         | TRANSIENT
   28         | VOLATILE
   29         | SYNCHRONIZED
   30         | NATIVE
   31         | DEFAULT
   32         | SEALED
   33         | NON_SEALED

   34 Modifiers: Modifier
   35          | Modifiers Modifier

   36 Annotation_Modifier: NormalAnnotation_Modifier
   37                    | MarkerAnnotation_Modifier
   38                    | SingleElementAnnotation_Modifier

   39 NormalAnnotation_Modifier: AT_Modifier TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValuePairList ')'
   40                          | AT_Modifier TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ')'

   41 MarkerAnnotation_Modifier: AT_Modifier TypeName

   42 SingleElementAnnotation_Modifier: AT_Modifier TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValue ')'

   43 TypeName_ModifierOrDims: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator
   44                        | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator

   45 PrimitiveType: Annotations UnannPrimitiveType

   46 NumericType: IntegralType
   47            | FloatingPointType

   48 IntegralType: BYTE
   49             | SHORT
   50             | INT
   51             | LONG
   52             | CHAR

   53 FloatingPointType: FLOAT
   54                  | DOUBLE

   55 ReferenceType: ClassOrInterfaceType
   56              | ArrayType

   57 ClassOrInterfaceType: UnannClassOrInterfaceType
   58                     | Annotations UnannClassOrInterfaceType

   59 ArrayType: Annotations UnannPrimitiveType Dims
   60          | Annotations UnannClassOrInterfaceType Dims
   61          | UnannArrayType

   62 Dims: Annotations_Dims '[' ']'
   63     | Annotations_Dims '[' ']' Dims
   64     | '[' ']'
   65     | '[' ']' Dims

   66 Annotation_Dims: NormalAnnotation_Dims
   67                | MarkerAnnotation_Dims
   68                | SingleElementAnnotation_Dims

   69 Annotations_Dims: Annotations_Dims Annotation_Dims
   70                 | Annotation_Dims

   71 NormalAnnotation_Dims: AT_Dims TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValuePairList ')'
   72                      | AT_Dims TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ')'

   73 MarkerAnnotation_Dims: AT_Dims TypeName

   74 SingleElementAnnotation_Dims: AT_Dims TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValue ')'

   75 TypeParameter: Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   76              | Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeBound
   77              | TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   78              | TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeBound

   79 TypeBound: EXTENDS ClassOrInterfaceType AdditionalBounds

   80 AdditionalBounds: AdditionalBounds AMPERSAND ClassOrInterfaceType
   81                 | %empty

   82 TypeArguments: '<' TypeArgumentList '>'
   83              | LANGLE TypeArgumentList '>'

   84 TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType: LANGLE TypeArgumentList '>'

   85 TypeArgumentList: TypeArgument
   86                 | TypeArgumentList ',' TypeArgument

   87 TypeArgument: ReferenceType
   88             | Wildcard

   89 Wildcard: Annotations '?' WildcardBounds
   90         | Annotations '?'
   91         | '?' WildcardBounds
   92         | '?'

   93 WildcardBounds: EXTENDS ReferenceType AdditionalBounds
   94               | SUPER ReferenceType

   95 ModuleName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   96           | IdentifierComplement
   97           | ModuleName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER
   98           | ModuleName DOT_CommonName IdentifierComplement

   99 ModuleNames: ModuleName
  100            | ModuleNames ',' ModuleName

  101 TypeName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  102         | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER

  103 TypeNames: TypeName
  104          | TypeNames ',' TypeName

  105 CommonName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  106           | IdentifierComplement
  107           | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  108           | CommonName DOT_CommonName IdentifierComplement

  109 CompilationUnit: OrdinaryCompilationUnit
  110                | ModularCompilationUnit

  111 OrdinaryCompilationUnit: PackageDeclaration ImportDeclarations TypeDeclarations
  112                        | ImportDeclarations TypeDeclarations
  113                        | PackageDeclaration TypeDeclarations
  114                        | TypeDeclarations

  115 ModularCompilationUnit: ImportDeclarations ModuleDeclaration
  116                       | ModuleDeclaration

  117 PackageDeclaration: Annotations PACKAGE CommonName ';'
  118                   | PACKAGE CommonName ';'

  119 ImportDeclarations: ImportDeclaration
  120                   | ImportDeclarations ImportDeclaration

  121 ImportDeclaration: SingleTypeImportDeclaration
  122                  | TypeImportOnDemandDeclaration
  123                  | SingleStaticImportDeclaration
  124                  | StaticImportOnDemandDeclaration

  125 SingleTypeImportDeclaration: IMPORT TypeName ';'

  126 TypeImportOnDemandDeclaration: IMPORT CommonName '.' '*' ';'

  127 SingleStaticImportDeclaration: IMPORT STATIC CommonName ';'

  128 StaticImportOnDemandDeclaration: IMPORT STATIC CommonName '.' '*' ';'

  129 TypeDeclarations: TypeDeclaration
  130                 | TypeDeclarations TypeDeclaration

  131 TypeDeclaration: ClassDeclaration
  132                | InterfaceDeclaration
  133                | EMPTY_STMT

  134 ModuleDeclaration: Annotations OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  135                  | Annotations MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  136                  | OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  137                  | MODULE CommonName '{' ModuleDirectives '}'
  138                  | Annotations OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' '}'
  139                  | Annotations MODULE CommonName '{' '}'
  140                  | OPEN MODULE CommonName '{' '}'
  141                  | MODULE CommonName '{' '}'

  142 ModuleDirectives: ModuleDirective
  143                 | ModuleDirectives ModuleDirective

  144 ModuleDirective: REQUIRES TRANSITIVE ModuleName ';'
  145                | REQUIRES ModuleName ';'
  146                | REQUIRES STATIC ModuleName ';'
  147                | EXPORTS CommonName ';'
  148                | EXPORTS CommonName TO ModuleNames ';'
  149                | OPENS CommonName ';'
  150                | OPENS CommonName TO ModuleNames ';'
  151                | USES TypeName ';'
  152                | PROVIDES TypeName WITH TypeNames ';'

  153 ArrayInitializer: '{' VariableInitializerList '}'
  154                 | '{' VariableInitializerList ',' '}'
  155                 | '{' '}'

  156 VariableInitializerList: VariableInitializer
  157                        | VariableInitializerList ',' VariableInitializer

  158 ClassDeclaration: NormalClassDeclaration
  159                 | EnumDeclaration

  160 NormalClassDeclaration: Modifiers CLASS TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptSuperclass OptSuperinterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits ClassBody
  161                       | CLASS TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptSuperclass OptSuperinterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits ClassBody

  162 OptTypeParameters: TypeParameters
  163                  | %empty

  164 OptSuperclass: Superclass
  165              | %empty

  166 OptSuperinterfaces: Superinterfaces
  167                   | %empty

  168 OptClassOrInterfacePermits: ClassOrInterfacePermits
  169                           | %empty

  170 TypeParameters: '<' TypeParameterList '>'
  171               | LANGLE TypeParameterList '>'

  172 TypeParameterList: TypeParameter
  173                  | TypeParameterList ',' TypeParameter

  174 Superclass: EXTENDS ClassOrInterfaceType

  175 Superinterfaces: IMPLEMENTS InterfaceTypeList

  176 InterfaceTypeList: ClassOrInterfaceType
  177                  | InterfaceTypeList ',' ClassOrInterfaceType

  178 ClassOrInterfacePermits: PERMITS TypeNames

  179 ClassBody: '{' ClassBodyDeclarationList '}'
  180          | '{' '}'

  181 ClassBodyDeclarationList: ClassBodyDeclaration
  182                         | ClassBodyDeclarationList ClassBodyDeclaration

  183 ClassBodyDeclaration: ClassMemberDeclaration
  184                     | InstanceInitializer
  185                     | StaticInitializer
  186                     | ConstructorDeclaration

  187 ClassMemberDeclaration: FieldDeclaration
  188                       | MethodDeclaration
  189                       | ClassDeclaration
  190                       | InterfaceDeclaration
  191                       | ';'
  192                       | EMPTY_STMT

  193 FieldDeclaration: Modifiers UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'
  194                 | UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'

  195 VariableDeclaratorList: VariableDeclarator
  196                       | VariableDeclaratorList ',' VariableDeclarator

  197 VariableDeclarator: VariableDeclaratorId '=' VariableInitializer
  198                   | VariableDeclaratorId

  199 VariableDeclaratorId: TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  200                     | IdentifierComplement Dims
  201                     | TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  202                     | IdentifierComplement

  203 VariableInitializer: Expression
  204                    | ArrayInitializer

  205 UnannType: UnannReferenceType
  206          | UnannPrimitiveType

  207 UnannPrimitiveType: NumericType
  208                   | BOOLEAN

  209 UnannReferenceType: UnannArrayType
  210                   | UnannClassOrInterfaceType

  211 UnannClassOrInterfaceType: TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  212                          | CommonName
  213                          | CommonName '.' Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  214                          | CommonName '.' Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  215                          | CommonName DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  216                          | UnannClassOrInterfaceType DOT TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  217                          | UnannClassOrInterfaceType DOT Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  218                          | UnannClassOrInterfaceType DOT Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER TypeArguments_UnannClassOrInterfaceType

  219 UnannArrayType: UnannPrimitiveType Dims
  220               | UnannClassOrInterfaceType Dims

  221 MethodDeclaration: Modifiers MethodHeader MethodBody
  222                  | MethodHeader MethodBody

  223 MethodHeader: Result MethodDeclarator Throws
  224             | Result MethodDeclarator
  225             | TypeParameters Annotations Result MethodDeclarator Throws
  226             | TypeParameters Annotations Result MethodDeclarator
  227             | TypeParameters Result MethodDeclarator Throws
  228             | TypeParameters Result MethodDeclarator

  229 Result: UnannType
  230       | VOID

  231 MethodDeclarator: IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')' Dims
  232                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ')' Dims
  233                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' FormalParameterList ')' Dims
  234                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims
  235                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')'
  236                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ReceiverParameter ')'
  237                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' FormalParameterList ')'
  238                 | IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')'

  239 ReceiverParameter: Annotations UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '.' THIS
  240                  | Annotations UnannType IdentifierComplement '.' THIS
  241                  | Annotations UnannType THIS
  242                  | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '.' THIS
  243                  | UnannType IdentifierComplement '.' THIS
  244                  | UnannType THIS

  245 FormalParameterList: FormalParameter
  246                    | FormalParameter ',' FormalParameterList

  247 FormalParameter: VariableModifiers UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  248                | Annotations UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  249                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  250                | VariableModifiers UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  251                | Annotations UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  252                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  253                | VariableModifiers UnannType IdentifierComplement Dims
  254                | Annotations UnannType IdentifierComplement Dims
  255                | UnannType IdentifierComplement Dims
  256                | VariableModifiers UnannType IdentifierComplement
  257                | Annotations UnannType IdentifierComplement
  258                | UnannType IdentifierComplement
  259                | VariableArityParameter
  260                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER DOT_CommonName TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  261                | UnannType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '.' TYPE_IDENTIFIER

  262 VariableArityParameter: VariableModifiers UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  263                       | VariableModifiers UnannType ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  264                       | Annotations UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  265                       | Annotations UnannType ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  266                       | UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  267                       | UnannType ELLIPSIS TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  268                       | VariableModifiers UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  269                       | VariableModifiers UnannType ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  270                       | Annotations UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  271                       | Annotations UnannType ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  272                       | UnannType Annotations ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement
  273                       | UnannType ELLIPSIS IdentifierComplement

  274 VariableModifiers: FINAL
  275                  | Annotations FINAL
  276                  | FINAL Annotations
  277                  | Annotations FINAL Annotations

  278 Throws: THROWS ExceptionTypeList

  279 ExceptionTypeList: ExceptionType
  280                  | ExceptionTypeList ',' ExceptionType

  281 ExceptionType: ClassOrInterfaceType

  282 MethodBody: Block
  283           | ';'

  284 InstanceInitializer: Block

  285 StaticInitializer: STATIC Block

  286 ConstructorDeclaration: Modifiers ConstructorDeclarator Throws ConstructorBody
  287                       | Modifiers ConstructorDeclarator ConstructorBody
  288                       | ConstructorDeclarator Throws ConstructorBody
  289                       | ConstructorDeclarator ConstructorBody

  290 ConstructorDeclarator: TypeParameters SimpleTypeName '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')'
  291                      | TypeParameters SimpleTypeName '(' FormalParameterList ')'
  292                      | TypeParameters SimpleTypeName '(' ')'
  293                      | SimpleTypeName '(' ReceiverParameter ',' FormalParameterList ')'
  294                      | SimpleTypeName '(' FormalParameterList ')'
  295                      | SimpleTypeName '(' ')'

  296 SimpleTypeName: TYPE_IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator

  297 ConstructorBody: '{' ExplicitConstructorInvocation BlockStatements '}'
  298                | '{' ExplicitConstructorInvocation '}'
  299                | '{' BlockStatements '}'
  300                | '{' '}'

  301 ExplicitConstructorInvocation: TypeArguments THIS '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  302                              | TypeArguments THIS '(' ')' ';'
  303                              | THIS '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  304                              | THIS '(' ')' ';'
  305                              | TypeArguments SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  306                              | TypeArguments SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  307                              | SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  308                              | SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  309                              | CommonName '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  310                              | CommonName '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  311                              | CommonName '.' SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  312                              | CommonName '.' SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  313                              | Primary '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  314                              | Primary '.' TypeArguments SUPER '(' ')' ';'
  315                              | Primary '.' SUPER '(' ArgumentList ')' ';'
  316                              | Primary '.' SUPER '(' ')' ';'

  317 EnumDeclaration: Modifiers ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration Superinterfaces EnumBody
  318                | Modifiers ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration EnumBody
  319                | ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration Superinterfaces EnumBody
  320                | ENUM TYPE_IDENTIFIER_EnumDeclaration EnumBody

  321 EnumBody: '{' EnumConstantList ',' EnumBodyDeclarations '}'
  322         | '{' EnumConstantList EnumBodyDeclarations '}'
  323         | '{' EnumConstantList '}'
  324         | '{' EnumConstantList ',' '}'
  325         | '{' EnumBodyDeclarations '}'
  326         | '{' '}'

  327 EnumConstantList: EnumConstant
  328                 | EnumConstantList ',' EnumConstant

  329 EnumConstant: Annotations SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  330             | Annotations SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')'
  331             | Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER ClassBody
  332             | Annotations TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  333             | SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  334             | SimpleTypeName '(' ArgumentList ')'
  335             | TYPE_IDENTIFIER ClassBody
  336             | TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  337             | Annotations IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  338             | Annotations IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')'
  339             | Annotations IdentifierComplement ClassBody
  340             | Annotations IdentifierComplement
  341             | IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  342             | IdentifierComplement '(' ArgumentList ')'
  343             | IdentifierComplement ClassBody
  344             | IdentifierComplement

  345 EnumBodyDeclarations: ';' ClassBodyDeclarationList

  346 InterfaceDeclaration: NormalInterfaceDeclaration
  347                     | AnnotationTypeDeclaration

  348 NormalInterfaceDeclaration: Modifiers INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptExtendsInterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits InterfaceBody
  349                           | INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER OptTypeParameters OptExtendsInterfaces OptClassOrInterfacePermits InterfaceBody

  350 ExtendsInterfaces: EXTENDS InterfaceTypeList

  351 OptExtendsInterfaces: ExtendsInterfaces
  352                     | %empty

  353 InterfaceBody: '{' InterfaceMemberDeclarationList '}'
  354              | '{' '}'

  355 InterfaceMemberDeclarationList: InterfaceMemberDeclaration
  356                               | InterfaceMemberDeclarationList InterfaceMemberDeclaration

  357 InterfaceMemberDeclaration: ConstantDeclaration
  358                           | InterfaceMethodDeclaration
  359                           | ClassDeclaration
  360                           | InterfaceDeclaration
  361                           | ';'
  362                           | EMPTY_STMT

  363 ConstantDeclaration: Modifiers UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'
  364                    | UnannType VariableDeclaratorList ';'

  365 InterfaceMethodDeclaration: Modifiers MethodHeader MethodBody
  366                           | MethodHeader MethodBody

  367 AnnotationTypeDeclaration: Modifiers AT_AnnotationTypeDeclaration INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  368                          | AT_AnnotationTypeDeclaration INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  369                          | Modifiers AT_Modifier INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  370                          | AT_Modifier INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  371                          | Modifiers '@' INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody
  372                          | '@' INTERFACE TYPE_IDENTIFIER AnnotationTypeBody

  373 AnnotationTypeBody: '{' AnnotationTypeMemberDeclarationList '}'
  374                   | '{' '}'

  375 AnnotationTypeMemberDeclarationList: AnnotationTypeMemberDeclaration
  376                                    | AnnotationTypeMemberDeclarationList AnnotationTypeMemberDeclaration

  377 AnnotationTypeMemberDeclaration: AnnotationTypeElementDeclaration
  378                                | ConstantDeclaration
  379                                | ClassDeclaration
  380                                | InterfaceDeclaration
  381                                | ';'
  382                                | EMPTY_STMT

  383 AnnotationTypeElementDeclaration: Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims DefaultValue ';'
  384                                 | Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims ';'
  385                                 | Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' DefaultValue ';'
  386                                 | Modifiers UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' ';'
  387                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims DefaultValue ';'
  388                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' Dims ';'
  389                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' DefaultValue ';'
  390                                 | UnannType IDENTIFIER_MethodDeclarator '(' ')' ';'

  391 DefaultValue: DEFAULT ElementValue

  392 Annotation: NormalAnnotation
  393           | MarkerAnnotation
  394           | SingleElementAnnotation

  395 Annotations: Annotations Annotation
  396            | Annotation

  397 NormalAnnotation: '@' TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValuePairList ')'
  398                 | '@' TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ')'

  399 ElementValuePairList: ElementValuePair
  400                     | ElementValuePairList ',' ElementValuePair

  401 ElementValuePair: TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' ElementValue
  402                 | IdentifierComplement '=' ElementValue

  403 ElementValue: ConditionalExpression
  404             | ElementValueArrayInitializer
  405             | Annotation

  406 ElementValueArrayInitializer: '{' ElementValueList ',' '}'
  407                             | '{' ElementValueList '}'
  408                             | '{' '}'

  409 ElementValueList: ElementValue
  410                 | ElementValueList ',' ElementValue

  411 MarkerAnnotation: '@' TypeName

  412 SingleElementAnnotation: '@' TypeName_ModifierOrDims '(' ElementValue ')'

  413 Block: '{' BlockStatements '}'
  414      | '{' '}'

  415 BlockStatements: BlockStatement
  416                | BlockStatements BlockStatement

  417 BlockStatement: LocalVariableDeclarationStatement
  418               | LocalClassOrInterfaceDeclaration
  419               | Statement

  420 LocalVariableDeclarationStatement: LocalVariableDeclaration ';'

  421 LocalVariableDeclaration: VariableModifiers LocalVariableType VariableDeclaratorList
  422                         | Annotations LocalVariableType VariableDeclaratorList
  423                         | LocalVariableType VariableDeclaratorList

  424 LocalVariableType: UnannType
  425                  | VAR

  426 LocalClassOrInterfaceDeclaration: ClassDeclaration
  427                                 | NormalInterfaceDeclaration

  428 Statement: StatementWithoutTrailingSubstatement
  429          | LabeledStatement
  430          | IfThenStatement
  431          | IfThenElseStatement
  432          | WhileStatement
  433          | ForStatement

  434 StatementNoShortIf: StatementWithoutTrailingSubstatement
  435                   | LabeledStatementNoShortIf
  436                   | IfThenElseStatementNoShortIf
  437                   | WhileStatementNoShortIf
  438                   | ForStatementNoShortIf

  439 StatementWithoutTrailingSubstatement: Block
  440                                     | EmptyStatement
  441                                     | ExpressionStatement
  442                                     | AssertStatement
  443                                     | SwitchStatement
  444                                     | DoStatement
  445                                     | BreakStatement
  446                                     | ContinueStatement
  447                                     | ReturnStatement
  448                                     | SynchronizedStatement
  449                                     | ThrowStatement
  450                                     | TryStatement
  451                                     | YieldStatement

  452 EmptyStatement: EMPTY_STMT
  453               | ';'

  454 LabeledStatement: TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Statement
  455                 | IdentifierComplement ':' Statement

  456 LabeledStatementNoShortIf: TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' StatementNoShortIf
  457                          | IdentifierComplement ':' StatementNoShortIf

  458 ExpressionStatement: StatementExpression ';'

  459 StatementExpression: Assignment
  460                    | PreIncrementExpression
  461                    | PreDecrementExpression
  462                    | PostIncrementExpression
  463                    | PostDecrementExpression
  464                    | MethodInvocation
  465                    | ClassInstanceCreationExpression

  466 IfThenStatement: IF '(' Expression ')' Statement

  467 IfThenElseStatement: IF '(' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf ELSE Statement

  468 IfThenElseStatementNoShortIf: IF '(' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf ELSE StatementNoShortIf

  469 AssertStatement: ASSERT Expression ';'
  470                | ASSERT Expression ':' Expression ';'

  471 SwitchStatement: SWITCH '(' Expression ')' SwitchBlock

  472 SwitchBlock: '{' SwitchRules '}'
  473            | '{' SwitchBlockStatementGroups '}'
  474            | '{' '}'

  475 SwitchRule: SwitchLabel ARROW Expression ';'
  476           | SwitchLabel ARROW Block
  477           | SwitchLabel ARROW ThrowStatement

  478 SwitchRules: SwitchRule
  479            | SwitchRules SwitchRule

  480 SwitchBlockStatementGroup: SwitchLabels BlockStatements

  481 SwitchBlockStatementGroups: SwitchBlockStatementGroup
  482                           | SwitchBlockStatementGroups SwitchBlockStatementGroup

  483 SwitchLabel: CASE CaseConstants
  484            | DEFAULT_SwitchLabel

  485 SwitchLabels: SwitchLabel ':'
  486             | SwitchLabels SwitchLabel ':'

  487 CaseConstant: ConditionalExpression

  488 CaseConstants: CaseConstant
  489              | CaseConstants ',' CaseConstant

  490 WhileStatement: WHILE '(' Expression ')' Statement

  491 WhileStatementNoShortIf: WHILE '(' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf

  492 DoStatement: DO Statement WHILE '(' Expression ')' ';'

  493 ForStatement: BasicForStatement
  494             | EnhancedForStatement

  495 ForStatementNoShortIf: BasicForStatementNoShortIf
  496                      | EnhancedForStatementNoShortIf

  497 BasicForStatement: FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  498                  | FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ')' Statement
  499                  | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  500                  | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ')' Statement
  501                  | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  502                  | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ')' Statement
  503                  | FOR '(' ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' Statement
  504                  | FOR '(' ';' ';' ')' Statement

  505 BasicForStatementNoShortIf: FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  506                           | FOR '(' ForInit ';' Expression ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf
  507                           | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  508                           | FOR '(' ForInit ';' ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf
  509                           | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  510                           | FOR '(' ';' Expression ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf
  511                           | FOR '(' ';' ';' ForUpdate ')' StatementNoShortIf
  512                           | FOR '(' ';' ';' ')' StatementNoShortIf

  513 ForInit: StatementExpressionList
  514        | LocalVariableDeclaration

  515 ForUpdate: StatementExpressionList

  516 StatementExpressionList: StatementExpression
  517                        | StatementExpressionList ',' StatementExpression

  518 EnhancedForStatement: FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  519                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  520                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  521                     | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' Statement
  522                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' Statement
  523                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' Statement
  524                     | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  525                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  526                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' Statement
  527                     | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' Statement
  528                     | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' Statement
  529                     | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' Statement

  530 EnhancedForStatementNoShortIf: FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  531                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  532                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  533                              | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  534                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  535                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  536                              | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  537                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  538                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement Dims ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  539                              | FOR '(' VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  540                              | FOR '(' Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf
  541                              | FOR '(' LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement ':' Expression ')' StatementNoShortIf

  542 BreakStatement: BREAK TYPE_IDENTIFIER ';'
  543               | BREAK IdentifierComplement ';'
  544               | BREAK ';'

  545 YieldStatement: YIELD Expression ';'

  546 ContinueStatement: CONTINUE ';'
  547                  | CONTINUE TYPE_IDENTIFIER ';'
  548                  | CONTINUE IdentifierComplement ';'

  549 ReturnStatement: RETURN Expression ';'
  550                | RETURN ';'

  551 ThrowStatement: THROW Expression ';'

  552 SynchronizedStatement: SYNCHRONIZED '(' Expression ')' Block

  553 TryStatement: TRY Block Catches
  554             | TRY Block Catches Finally
  555             | TRY Block Finally
  556             | TryWithResourcesStatement

  557 Catches: CatchClause
  558        | Catches CatchClause

  559 CatchClause: CATCH '(' CatchFormalParameter ')' Block

  560 CatchFormalParameter: VariableModifiers CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  561                     | Annotations CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  562                     | CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER Dims
  563                     | VariableModifiers CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  564                     | Annotations CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  565                     | CatchType TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  566                     | VariableModifiers CatchType IdentifierComplement Dims
  567                     | Annotations CatchType IdentifierComplement Dims
  568                     | CatchType IdentifierComplement Dims
  569                     | VariableModifiers CatchType IdentifierComplement
  570                     | Annotations CatchType IdentifierComplement
  571                     | CatchType IdentifierComplement

  572 CatchType: UnannClassOrInterfaceType
  573          | CatchType '|' ClassOrInterfaceType

  574 Finally: FINALLY Block

  575 TryWithResourcesStatement: TRY ResourceSpecification Block Catches Finally
  576                          | TRY ResourceSpecification Block Catches
  577                          | TRY ResourceSpecification Block Finally
  578                          | TRY ResourceSpecification Block

  579 ResourceSpecification: '(' ResourceList ')'
  580                      | '(' ResourceList ';' ')'

  581 ResourceList: Resource
  582             | ResourceList ';' Resource

  583 Resource: VariableModifiers LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' Expression
  584         | Annotations LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' Expression
  585         | LocalVariableType TYPE_IDENTIFIER '=' Expression
  586         | VariableModifiers LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement '=' Expression
  587         | Annotations LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement '=' Expression
  588         | LocalVariableType IdentifierComplement '=' Expression
  589         | VariableAccess

  590 VariableAccess: CommonName
  591               | FieldAccess

  592 Pattern: TypePattern

  593 TypePattern: LocalVariableDeclaration_TypePattern

  594 LocalVariableDeclaration_TypePattern: VariableModifiers LocalVariableType VariableDeclarator
  595                                     | Annotations LocalVariableType VariableDeclarator
  596                                     | LocalVariableType VariableDeclarator

  597 Primary: PrimaryNoNewArray
  598        | ArrayCreationExpression

  599 PrimaryNoNewArray: Literal
  600                  | ClassLiteral
  601                  | THIS
  602                  | CommonName '.' THIS
  603                  | '(' Expression ')'
  604                  | ClassInstanceCreationExpression
  605                  | FieldAccess
  606                  | ArrayAccess
  607                  | MethodInvocation
  608                  | MethodReference

  609 ClassLiteral: CommonName DimsNoAnnotations '.' CLASS
  610             | NumericType DimsNoAnnotations '.' CLASS
  611             | BOOLEAN DimsNoAnnotations '.' CLASS
  612             | CommonName '.' CLASS
  613             | NumericType '.' CLASS
  614             | BOOLEAN '.' CLASS
  615             | VOID '.' CLASS

  616 DimsNoAnnotations: LBRACK ']'
  617                  | DimsNoAnnotations LBRACK ']'

  618 ClassInstanceCreationExpression: UnqualifiedClassInstanceCreationExpression
  619                                | CommonName '.' UnqualifiedClassInstanceCreationExpression
  620                                | Primary '.' UnqualifiedClassInstanceCreationExpression

  621 UnqualifiedClassInstanceCreationExpression: NEW TypeArguments ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  622                                           | NEW TypeArguments ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ArgumentList ')'
  623                                           | NEW TypeArguments ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ')' ClassBody
  624                                           | NEW TypeArguments ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ')'
  625                                           | NEW ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ArgumentList ')' ClassBody
  626                                           | NEW ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ArgumentList ')'
  627                                           | NEW ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ')' ClassBody
  628                                           | NEW ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate '(' ')'

  629 ClassOrInterfaceTypeToInstantiate: AnnotationIdentifiers TypeArgumentsOrDiamond
  630                                  | AnnotationIdentifiers

  631 AnnotationIdentifiers: Annotations IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers
  632                      | IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers
  633                      | AnnotationIdentifiers '.' Annotations IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers
  634                      | AnnotationIdentifiers '.' IDENTIFIER_AnnotationIdentifiers

  635 TypeArgumentsOrDiamond: TypeArguments
  636                       | DIAMOND

  637 FieldAccess: Primary '.' TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  638            | SUPER '.' TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  639            | CommonName '.' SUPER '.' TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  640            | Primary '.' IdentifierComplement
  641            | SUPER '.' IdentifierComplement
  642            | CommonName '.' SUPER '.' IdentifierComplement

  643 ArrayAccess: CommonName LBRACK_ArrayAccess Expression ']'
  644            | PrimaryNoNewArray LBRACK_ArrayAccess Expression ']'
