  671                | ReferenceType DOUBLE_COLON TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  672                | SUPER DOUBLE_COLON TypeArguments TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  673                | SUPER DOUBLE_COLON TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  674                | CommonName '.' SUPER DOUBLE_COLON TypeArguments TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  675                | CommonName '.' SUPER DOUBLE_COLON TYPE_IDENTIFIER
  676                | Primary DOUBLE_COLON TypeArguments IdentifierComplement
  677                | Primary DOUBLE_COLON IdentifierComplement
  678                | ReferenceType DOUBLE_COLON TypeArguments IdentifierComplement
  679                | ReferenceType DOUBLE_COLON IdentifierComplement
  680                | SUPER DOUBLE_COLON TypeArguments IdentifierComplement
  681                | SUPER DOUBLE_COLON IdentifierComplement
  682                | CommonName '.' SUPER DOUBLE_COLON TypeArguments IdentifierComplement
  683                | CommonName '.' SUPER DOUBLE_COLON IdentifierComplement
  684                | ReferenceType DOUBLE_COLON TypeArguments NEW
  685                | ReferenceType DOUBLE_COLON NEW

  686 ArrayCreationExpression: NEW PrimitiveType DimExprs Dims
  687                        | NEW PrimitiveType DimExprs
  688                        | NEW UnannPrimitiveType DimExprs Dims
  689                        | NEW UnannPrimitiveType DimExprs
  690                        | NEW ClassOrInterfaceType DimExprs Dims
