  693                        | NEW UnannPrimitiveType Dims ArrayInitializer
  694                        | NEW ClassOrInterfaceType Dims ArrayInitializer

  695 DimExprs: DimExpr
  696         | DimExprs DimExpr

  697 DimExpr: Annotations_Dims LBRACK_ArrayAccess Expression ']'
