  699 Expression: LambdaExpression
  700           | AssignmentExpression

  701 LambdaExpression: LambdaParameters ARROW LambdaBody

  702 LambdaParameters: '(' LambdaParameterList ')'
  703                 | '(' ')'
  704                 | TYPE_IDENTIFIER_IdentifierforLambdaParameterList
  705                 | IdentifierComplement_IdentifierforLambdaParameterList

